# Policy: do NOT use *.lock — that silently hides package lockfiles (package-lock.json,
# yarn.lock, etc.) which should be committed to pin dependency trees.
# Tuist/.build/ and Tuist/Dependencies/ (below) cover Tuist-generated lock artefacts.

# Build output. Named for the retired Electron/Node stack (TASK-064) — kept ignored because a local
# tree may still hold its leftovers (0.2.x DMG blockmaps, the electron-updater latest-mac.yml).
# Nothing in the Swift build writes here; the DMG lands in build/ via release-dmg.yml.
dist/

# macOS metadata
.DS_Store

# Antigravity CLI sessions
.antigravitycli/

# Internal AI session notes
claude/

# Chrome Web Store submission binaries (use GitHub Releases instead)
chromestore/*.zip
chromestore/*.png

# View screenshots
screenshots/
